––– comment –––
D08: a failed remote data call fails the whole load at once and cancels the other targets. A
repeated request does not continue it after the node is back; the commit returns the error and
removes the load, and a new full load passes.
––– input –––
source /tmp/rb.sh; gen r 20001 20030 > /tmp/s1.ndjson; gen r 20031 20060 > /tmp/s2.ndjson; post r '' /tmp/s1.ndjson; stop 2; post r '' /tmp/s2.ndjson; kids; start 2; post r '' /tmp/s2.ndjson; commit r ''
