––– comment –––
A coordinator killed during a load leaves the remote pool: the next load is refused on it with
the PURGE hint, PURGE BULK_IMPORT by the shard table name on the coordinator cancels it on the
other node, and the load passes.
––– input –––
source /tmp/rb.sh; gen r 90001 90030 > /tmp/o.ndjson; post r '' /tmp/o.ndjson; kids; kill -9 $(cat /var/log/manticore-1/searchd.pid); for i in $(seq 1 50); do [ $(ps -eo args | grep -c "[i]ndexer_rt_bulk_chunk") -le 1 ] && break; sleep 0.1; done; kids; start 1; post r '' /tmp/o.ndjson; commit r ''
