1
––– comment –––
PURGE BULK_IMPORT by the name of a distributed table goes to every table of every agent, one
command per table; an unreachable agent is reported, not hidden.
––– input –––
source /tmp/rb.sh; sql 2306 "CREATE TABLE da (title TEXT); CREATE TABLE db (title TEXT)"; sql 1306 "CREATE TABLE d TYPE='distributed' AGENT='127.0.0.1:2312:da,db'; CREATE TABLE dx TYPE='distributed' AGENT='127.0.0.1:2312:da' AGENT='127.0.0.1:3312:dc'"; sql 1306 "PURGE BULK_IMPORT FROM TABLE d OPTION clear_sessions=1"; echo "rc=$?"; sql 1306 "PURGE BULK_IMPORT FROM TABLE dx OPTION clear_sessions=1"
––– output –––
rc=0
ERROR 1064 (42000) at line 1: table dc: agent 127.0.0.1:3312: #!/[^"]+/!#
––– comment –––
An agent that refuses PURGE (a load is open on its table and the option is not given) is reported
with its own error; a pool on a mirror that is not the first one is purged as well, while the
unreachable first mirror is reported.
––– input –––
source /tmp/rb.sh; sql 1306 "CREATE TABLE dr TYPE='distributed' AGENT='127.0.0.1:2312:r_1'; CREATE TABLE dm TYPE='distributed' AGENT='127.0.0.1:3312:r_1|127.0.0.1:2312:r_1'"; post r '' /tmp/o.ndjson; kids; sql 1306 "PURGE BULK_IMPORT FROM TABLE dr"; sql 1306 "PURGE BULK_IMPORT FROM TABLE dm OPTION clear_sessions=1"; kids; sql 1306 "PURGE BULK_IMPORT FROM TABLE r OPTION clear_sessions=1"; kids
